abstract: >-
  Exact backbite diameter of the squared path, with path reversals identified.
  The arbitrary-pair upper bound is analytic for n at least 16; the finite
  bases are explicitly computed. AI-assisted and not human peer reviewed.
  Independent AI proof and computation audits report PASS. The independent
  reference audit and scholarly novelty remain INCONCLUSIVE. No priority
  claim is made. All rights reserved. The DOI is reserved pending publication.
